<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 3.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 3.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell slightly to 3.23 percent on Wednesday from 3.66 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
